"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
1702,"Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Bashshar — narrated to us Muhammad (meaning Ibn Ja'far) — narrated to us Shu'bah, who said: I heard Abu Ishaq narrating, on the authority of Harithah ibn Wahb al-Khuza'i (RA), who said:
""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) led us in prayer at Mina, performing two rak'ahs, more than we had ever done before and feeling secure in doing so.""

**CHAPTER:**"
